            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Choose how the layouts look</h2>
<ul>
  <li>A new Block visibility setting lets you choose how strongly the layout blocks stand out: Less, Normal or More. Less is the look from earlier versions, and More is the bolder look from 1.3.8. Normal, in between, is the default.</li>
  <li>The change applies everywhere at once: the menu bar, Quick Snap on the green button, and Settings.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
